Court is in session!

299
00:12:43,090 --> 00:12:45,690
♪The candle burns down
to its final glow♪

300
00:12:46,650 --> 00:12:49,050
♪Cold fragrance clings to my hem♪

301
00:12:49,690 --> 00:12:51,450
♪You gently smooth my hair♪

302
00:12:51,450 --> 00:12:54,370
♪Yet your gaze drifts far away♪

303
00:12:56,810 --> 00:12:59,250
♪A hidden blade lies beneath your smile♪

304
00:12:59,610 --> 00:13:02,930
♪You turn away
as if nothing has changed♪

305
00:13:03,530 --> 00:13:05,090
♪Step by step, I walk away♪

306
00:13:05,250 --> 00:13:08,570
♪Each step breaks my heart anew♪

307
00:13:11,330 --> 00:13:14,210
♪If fate had not gone astray♪

308
00:13:14,730 --> 00:13:17,810
♪Why leave me
standing alone in the wind?♪

309
00:13:18,250 --> 00:13:20,850
♪We shared one fleeting life together♪

310
00:13:20,850 --> 00:13:24,890
♪Yet all that's left
is warmth upon my fingertips♪

311
00:13:25,130 --> 00:13:28,170
♪I'd melt this night into ink♪

312
00:13:28,570 --> 00:13:31,250
♪And write of every meeting
and every parting♪

313
00:13:31,250 --> 00:13:33,970
♪If next life asks
about the days gone by♪

314
00:13:34,250 --> 00:13:37,210
♪I'll only say that once♪

315
00:13:37,690 --> 00:13:39,450
♪I called your name♪

316
00:13:44,050 --> 00:13:46,290
♪The silent stars hang low♪

317
00:13:47,690 --> 00:13:49,890
♪The river keeps flowing east♪

318
00:13:51,130 --> 00:13:53,050
♪I linger in the old tower♪

319
00:13:53,170 --> 00:13:56,810
♪Waiting for you,
though all is now empty♪

320
00:13:58,130 --> 00:14:00,570
♪This life still owes us a bow♪

321
00:14:01,450 --> 00:14:04,250
♪May the next repay us with a dream♪

322
00:14:05,010 --> 00:14:07,250
♪Beyond here lie
endless mountains and rivers♪

323
00:14:07,250 --> 00:14:13,490
♪I dare not turn for one last look♪

324
00:14:13,770 --> 00:14:16,650
♪If fate had not gone astray♪

325
00:14:17,250 --> 00:14:20,730
♪Why bury this heart beneath the frost?♪

326
00:14:20,730 --> 00:14:23,370
♪We shared one fleeting life together♪

327
00:14:23,370 --> 00:14:27,650
♪Now only fading warmth
remains in my palm♪

328
00:14:27,650 --> 00:14:30,570
♪I'd melt this night into ink♪

329
00:14:31,010 --> 00:14:33,730
♪And paint a winter between your brows♪

330
00:14:33,730 --> 00:14:36,410
♪If we meet again in another life♪

331
00:14:36,730 --> 00:14:39,450
♪Will you believe that tonight♪

332
00:14:40,130 --> 00:14:42,410
♪Was when we first met?♪

333
00:14:43,690 --> 00:14:46,090
♪Will you believe that tonight♪

334
00:14:47,210 --> 00:14:48,970
♪Was when we met for the last time?♪
